<!-- ════════════════ 19 · COMMANDS & SKILLS ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Commands &amp; skills" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #db2777;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="m7 9 3 3-3 3"/><path d="M13 15h4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">19</span>Extend</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Package recurring prompts as <span class="accent">commands or skills</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 36px; align-content: start;">

        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab"><i class="bi bi-copilot"></i>GitHub Copilot</span>
          <h3>Prompt files &amp; skills</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Prompt files: <code>.github/prompts/*.prompt.md</code>, invoked with <code>/name</code>.</li>
            <li>Skills: <code>.github/skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md</code>, invoked by description.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab"><i class="bi bi-claude"></i>Claude Code</span>
          <h3>Commands &amp; skills</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Custom commands merged into Skills; <code>.claude/commands</code> still works.</li>
            <li>Commands in <code>.claude/commands</code>, skills in <code>.claude/skills</code>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab"><i class="bi bi-cursor"></i>Cursor</span>
          <h3>Skills <span style="font-size: 0.55em; opacity: 0.7;">(2.4+)</span></h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Commands and skills both folded into Skills in Cursor 2.4 (Jan 2026); <code>/migrate-to-skills</code> converts old ones.</li>
            <li>Invoke with <code>/</code> or let the agent pick by description.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>Command vs. skill:</strong> a command is something you invoke; a skill is something the agent invokes by itself when the description matches the task.
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "19" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "55" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
